# Resend API key — get one at https://resend.com
# Free tier sends up to 3,000 emails/month (100/day)
RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Once you verify a domain in Resend, replace the from address in
# app/api/contact/route.ts with: noreply@yourdomain.com
# Until then the sandbox sender (onboarding@resend.dev) delivers only
# to the Resend account owner's email address.
